   "fen": "r1bq1knr/pp1pbBpp/2p5/n4Q2/4P3/2Pp1N2/PP3PPP/RNB1K2R b KQ - 1 9",
   "line": [
    "Qf5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Even after a surprise resource, don't hit the panic button — just identify the real issue. The danger is a discovered check, and a knight to f6 interposes between the queen and bishop, which is cleaner than the bishop block that would allow a capture.",
   "kind": "tactic"
  },
  {
   "ply": 18,
   "t": 351.5,
   "fen": "r1bq1k1r/pp1pbBpp/2p2n2/n4Q2/4P3/2Pp1N2/PP3PPP/RNB1K2R w KQ - 2 10",
