   "line": [
    "Ng5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Development stays the priority. When the knight lunges in defending the bishop, stay logical — but before kicking it, do the discipline: look for the opponent's checks and rule out any weird mating sequence. Only once it's confirmed safe do you proceed.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
