   "line": [
    "Qd1",
    "Nxg6"
   ],
   "spoken": "A recurring truth about strong lower-rated opponents: they're excellent in the opening and rattle off good tactical moves, but keep your composure and they'll lose theirs first. Sometimes winning is just outlasting them in the calculation.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
  {
