   "spoken": "Converting the ending is a matter of order: centralise the king, bring the rooks to the open files, and identify the wing where a passed pawn can be made — that passer is ultimately what wins. Keep one eye always on knight forks, and the finish is a rook lift that dislodges the blockading knight so the pawn can promote.",
